      "text": "Nix provides environment consistency through\ndeclarative specifications of dependencies.\nDocker packages an entire runtime, whereas Nix\nreproducibly constructs the environment from a\nversion-controlled definition. Teams often use\nNix for development environments and Docker\nfor deployment runtimes.",
      "fontSize": 16.75838969481701,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Nix provides environment consistency through declarative specifications of dependencies. Docker packages an entire runtime, whereas Nix reproducibly constructs the environment from a version-controlled definition. Teams often use Nix for development environments and Docker for deployment runtimes.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
